--- bindings
{"ITEMS": {"kind": "relation", "from": "items", "fields": {"TOTAL": {"kind": "column", "column": "total", "type": "NUM"}}}}
--- as
statement
--- source
ITEMS .> SORT_BY(_["total"])
--- expect
SELECT * FROM `items` ORDER BY `total` ASC
===

