### name: stmt.limit-offset.take
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"ITEMS": {"kind": "relation", "from": "items"}}
--- as
statement
--- source
ITEMS .> TAKE(10)
--- expect
SELECT * FROM `items` LIMIT 10
===

### name: stmt.limit-offset.take-and-drop
--- dialect
mariadb
--- bindings
{"ITEMS": {"kind": "relation", "from": "items"}}
--- as
statement
--- source
ITEMS .> TAKE(10) .> DROP(20)
--- expect
SELECT * FROM `items` LIMIT 10 OFFSET 20
===

